# Test video corpus — 1.8 GB, including a 1.16 GB video.tar.gz.
# The *.mov / *.mp4 rules above are lowercase, so they match on macOS
# (case-insensitive) but NOT on the Jetson's Linux filesystem — which is why
# `git status` there offers to commit files GitHub would reject at 100 MB.
